      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "format: html\n",
        "bibliography: \"references.bib\"\n",
        "execute: \n",
        "  eval: false\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "The $\\texttt{deep\\_tensor}$ package contains a [PyTorch](https://pytorch.org) implementation of the deep inverse Rosenblatt transport (DIRT) algorithm introduced by @Cui2022.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-warning}\n",
        "This package is currently in a developmental state. Some parts of the API may change without warning in future releases.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "# Installation\n",
        "\n",
        "$\\texttt{deep\\_tensor}$ can be installed using pip:\n"
      ],
      "id": "598d0e42"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pip install deep-tensor-py"
      ],
      "id": "6ddb5c0d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "The package can then be imported using\n"
      ],
      "id": "cb12b43e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import deep_tensor as dt"
      ],
      "id": "94c23dd0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Getting Started\n",
        "\n",
        "Check out the [examples page](/examples/index.qmd) and [API reference](/reference/index.qmd) for help getting started with $\\texttt{deep\\_tensor}$."
      ],
      "id": "1fe357d4"
    }
